1
00:00:12,282 --> 00:00:15,322
Evening, brother - door stay open wide,

2
00:00:15,402 --> 00:00:17,762
Light in the window - we still hold the pride.

3
00:00:18,122 --> 00:00:20,423
Table ain't stacked, but the soul stay full,

4
00:00:20,503 --> 00:00:22,923
Quiet prayers hit harder than any pull.

5
00:00:23,623 --> 00:00:26,003
Seen winter deep in a man' cold stare,

6
00:00:26,343 --> 00:00:28,544
Silence heavier than the weight we bear.

7
00:00:28,784 --> 00:00:31,244
Open up, no cap, no need to front,

8
00:00:31,864 --> 00:00:34,164
Real in your chest ain't never been done.

9
00:00:34,224 --> 00:00:36,785
Good evening - more than lines we drop,

10
00:00:37,325 --> 00:00:39,645
War and night couldn't make this stop.

11
00:00:39,705 --> 00:00:42,545
Stand tall, my fam - let the cold wind pass,

12
00:00:42,845 --> 00:00:45,266
Light still burnin' from the hustle we cast.

13
00:00:45,286 --> 00:00:48,546
Good evening - truth cut through the haze,

14
00:00:48,566 --> 00:00:50,706
Even when the whole game’s rigged for days.

15
00:00:50,726 --> 00:00:53,627
Stand tall, my fam - hear the low-key call,

16
00:00:53,887 --> 00:00:56,247
Hope stay alive in the smallest hall.

17
00:00:56,787 --> 00:00:59,027
Bread on the table - from hard-earned days,

18
00:00:59,547 --> 00:01:01,788
Scars and patience, not for praise.

19
00:01:02,008 --> 00:01:04,548
I ain't no saint - still learnin' the way,

20
00:01:04,568 --> 00:01:07,088
Split your last piece, watch the load decay.

21
00:01:07,768 --> 00:01:10,109
No big speeches shinin' like chains,

22
00:01:10,149 --> 00:01:12,769
Just "come through, fam" when the cold remains.

23
00:01:12,849 --> 00:01:15,649
World outside loud, spinnin' too fast,

24
00:01:15,969 --> 00:01:18,390
Peace in this spot - the realest track last.

25
00:01:18,410 --> 00:01:21,070
Good evening - sign we still hold breath,

26
00:01:21,210 --> 00:01:23,710
Ain't sold our soul to streets or stress.

27
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:26,591
Rise up, my people - through the smoke and freeze,

28
00:01:27,191 --> 00:01:29,391
Light survive when the heart don't cease.

29
00:01:29,431 --> 00:01:32,211
Good evening - no mask, straight through,

30
00:01:32,491 --> 00:01:34,912
Proof we human under skies so blue.

31
00:01:34,952 --> 00:01:37,732
Rise up, my people - year after year,

32
00:01:38,032 --> 00:01:40,372
World keep turnin' on the ones sincere.

33
00:01:40,973 --> 00:01:43,193
Guest or owner - don't change a thing,

34
00:01:43,913 --> 00:01:45,973
Open hearts make the whole world swing.

35
00:01:46,313 --> 00:01:48,573
Drop "good evening" - path get lit,

36
00:01:49,054 --> 00:01:51,074
Hope live long as we never quit.

37
00:01:51,474 --> 00:01:54,174
Good evening - more than a sound tonight,

38
00:01:54,694 --> 00:01:56,975
Night and war couldn't kill our fight.

39
00:01:56,995 --> 00:01:59,635
Rise up, my people - hear the real within,

40
00:02:00,095 --> 00:02:02,475
Light was born - the light gon' win.

41
00:02:02,495 --> 00:02:05,056
Good evening - grip it, never break,

42
00:02:05,596 --> 00:02:07,996
Dark try hard but the light gon' stay.

43
00:02:08,116 --> 00:02:10,856
Rise up, my people - simple, no fear:

44
00:02:11,136 --> 00:02:13,817
Hope still breathin' long as we here.

